{"about_the_game":"Go on a scavenger-hunt adventure that spans <strong>84 hand-crafted levels</strong>, while getting to know the four friends who struggle to keep their video game studio together. <br><br>You may find much more than just cats on this journey... <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624670/extras/787a67075eb2d35ffb87fe3969decee2.poster.avif?t=1768011270\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624670/extras/787a67075eb2d35ffb87fe3969decee2.webm?t=1768011270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624670/extras/787a67075eb2d35ffb87fe3969decee2.mp4?t=1768011270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Matt's Hidden Cats features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Thousands of items to find, and <strong>20+ hours of gameplay</strong>.</li><li><strong>3 difficulty modes</strong>, with different goals in each, allowing for multiple play-throughs.</li><li>Spot-the-difference challenges, and other <strong>secret game modes</strong>.</li><li>A <strong>meta narrative</strong> about game development and friendship.</li><li>Occasional dark humour. (disabled by default for a family-friendly experience)</li><li>Lots of accessibility options. (play at your own pace)</li><li><strong>100% DRM-free</strong>, so you can make a copy for your grandma!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624670/extras/7d3e2c58aeda25fdab3e586b2ad3dcb2.avif?t=1768011270\" width=1276 height=228 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2624670?t=1768011270","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=17